51	action	The storm reaches the island. Shutters bang against the stone
52	action	walls and the lamp room fills with salt spray. Mara braces
53	action	the door with a chair. Theo drags the generator cable across
54	action	the floor while the needle on the pressure gauge keeps
55	action	falling. The lamp sputters.
